{% endif %}{% if "portable" in pieces %}{% else %}| D-027 | 2026-11-24 | all          | Owner delegation: with `[approvals] owner_delegation = "all"` (quorum only, read at the PR's base, set by an owner-approved PR) the quorum signature also approves the trust root and R-weaken, still after green required checks and two clean verdicts from different reviewer sessions on the exact head; no halt, unseen diff or secret value. Environment taps, GitHub settings and secrets stay the owner's. keelstackhq/keelstack has it on. Amends D-022. [why](decisions/027-owner-delegation.md)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
{% endif %}{% if "portable" in pieces %}{% else %}| D-028 | 2026-11-25 | all          | Flow v2: one requirement is one issue, one branch, one big PR (related follow-ups collected into it); in-session `implementer` subagents by default, child sessions only for separate requirements, checked every 20-30 min; one clean independent verdict on the exact head is enough (`[review] verdicts_needed = 1`); only blocker findings (security, data loss, broken main, broken release) block (`block_on = "blocker"`), the rest go to the rolling `bosun:followups` issue (`bosun followups add`) for the next PR in that area; main-open warns (`[main_health] block = false`), a red main gets a mainfix PR first but other work moves on; the orchestrator merges once required checks are green; the signer approves, the owner approves batched in one message the PRs it refuses (`.github/**`, scripts, R-ci, secrets, environments) and keeps the `release` tap. Amends D-021, D-022, D-027 (verdict count and blocking level only; no row removed). [why](decisions/028-flow-v2.md)                                                               |
